<title>USA: Witco Corp Q4 oper net per share is $0.13.</title>
<headline>Witco Corp Q4 oper net per share is $0.13.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $5.33     loss	 $0.36</p>
<p> Net loss		 303,202     loss	20,594</p>
<p> Revs		     540,395		  535,992</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  56,912		   56,569</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $5.54   profit	 $1.85</p>
<p> Net loss		 315,087   profit     104,445</p>
<p> Revs		   2,263,327		1,985,077</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  56,900		   56,549</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Quarter and full-year results hurt by one-time charges totaling $436.1 million, mostly in connection with restructuring. Operating earnings for Q4 were $0.13 per share, &quot;essentially equal&quot; to Q4 1995.</p>
<p>For the full year, operating net was $1.11, down from $1.16 for 1995.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
